<title>USA: Leap to plan campaign for new Daewoo car.</title>
<headline>Leap to plan campaign for new Daewoo car.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leap Group Inc said it has been selected to develop an advertising campaign for the eleven-state Midwest area for the introduction of Korean carmaker Daewoo Motor Co Ltd's new car line scheduled for launch in early 1998.</p>
<p>Billings are estimated at $12 million annually.</p>
<p>Strategic and creative development is expected to include television, print, radio, outdoor, new media and sales promotions, Leap said in a news release.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
